title: "MLuBMS: Data-Adaptive Multi-Level Building Material Stock Modeling with an Ontology-Aligned Framework"
abstract: "Ontology, reasoning/calculation code, validation scripts and an anonymized case-study database accompanying the paper 'Data-Adaptive Multi-Level Building Material Stock Modeling: An Ontology-Aligned Framework' (Pei, Xiong, Cao, Habert, Stouffs; submitted to Resources, Conservation & Recycling, 2026)."
